{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_13501","headline":"台中书怀 · 蒋冽","name":"台中书怀","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"持宪当休明，饬躬免颠沛。\n直绳备豪右，正色清冠盖。\n寄切才恨薄，职雄班匪大。\n坐居三独中，立在百僚外。\n简牍时休暇，依然秋兴多。\n披书唯骨鲠，循迹少闲和。\n庭树凌霜柏，池倾萎露荷。\n岁寒应可见，感此遂成歌。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"蒋冽","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_13501.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_13501","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}